  - m_Id: 27559454466048
    m_Localized: In-Game - Evolution Window
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27559454466049
    m_Localized: In-Game - Skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421803380802
    m_Localized: 'You can open the menu by clicking the buttons above or clicking
      their locations in the image.

      

      From the left, the buttons are:
      <color=red>Collection</color>, <color=blue>Achievements</color>, Play, <color=green>Queen
      Select</color>, and <color=white>Power Up</color>.

      

      Click the
      Play button in the center to start the game.  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421803380803
    m_Localized: 'There is a map on the bottom right. You can move the camera using
      the WASD keys or click on the map with the left mouse button to quickly move
      to that area.  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421803380804
    m_Localized: 'You can open the Evolution Window by clicking the button on the
      top left or pressing the R key.

      

      In the Evolution Window, you
      can drag evolved monsters with the left mouse button into slots to register
      them.

      

      Monsters placed in the slots can be queued for summoning
      using number keys 1 to 6.

      

      You can summon them only in empty
      spaces inside the castle using a left-click.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421803380805
    m_Localized: 'Press the Tab key to switch to the skill slots.

      

      The
      first slot always contains the Queen''s unique skill. Like monsters, you can
      queue skills using number keys 1 to 6.

      

      Use the left mouse
      button to cast the skill in an appropriate area.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
