    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992190
    m_Localized: "Even at breakfast, even at lunch\u2014meat all the time! The basic
      Orc unit, simple but packed with raw power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992191
    m_Localized: "They don\u2019t use their heads, but they do use their might. A
      reckless warrior whose philosophy is to charge straight ahead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992192
    m_Localized: "If a shaman\u2019s spell fails, they\u2019ll proudly say \u201CThat\u2019s
      how it was supposed to work.\u201D They\u2019re the only ones who know the
      truth."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992193
    m_Localized: "They survived the fight by accident\u2014and got stronger because
      of it. A true Orc prodigy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992194
    m_Localized: Their Rage Gauge has been maxed since birth! Their joy in life is
      hitting and smashing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992195
    m_Localized: "Now they blame failed spells on \u201Chumans not understanding
      high magic.\u201D The other orcs have chosen to just believe them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992196
    m_Localized: "Just bones, but sturdy ones. The most basic of the basics\u2014a
      skeleton who\u2019s at least grateful to be fighting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992197
    m_Localized: "A skeleton, but fine with holding a sword! Don\u2019t let its frail
      looks fool you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992198
    m_Localized: "Their joints may creak, but their skills haven\u2019t rusted. When
      they creak\u2026 someone\u2019s about to feel a blow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992199
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t underestimate the bone wizard. When they cast a spell,
      enemies are instantly rattled to their core."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992200
    m_Localized: A skeleton who was once a knight. They may not remember it, but
      they still carry the proper swagger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992201
    m_Localized: "Channeling focus at each joint, they fire a silent shot from afar.
      Don\u2019t let your guard down\u2014even from a distance, bones can shatter
      in an instant."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992202
    m_Localized: "A skeleton with powerful magic\u2026 You\u2019d almost mistake
      them for a final boss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992203
    m_Localized: "A basic Elf scout, dashing through the forest with a bow. \u201CFast
      and precise\u2014delivering all news from the woods!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992204
    m_Localized: "An Elf traditional archer who shoots arrows faster than the wind.
      Once they take aim, the enemy doesn\u2019t even think about running."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992205
    m_Localized: "An Elf long-range hunter who hits targets far beyond. Legend says
      they \u201Ccould hit with eyes closed,\u201D but they actually prefer to keep
      them open."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992206
    m_Localized: "A close\u2011combat forest specialist, combining swift movement
      and agile swordplay. The enemy\u2019s greatest fear is not knowing when\u2014or
      where\u2014they\u2019ll strike."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992207
    m_Localized: A steadfast Elf knight guarding the woods. Behind that shining armor
      beats the heart of a "Guardian of the Forest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992208
    m_Localized: "A Dark Elf who moves like a shadow through the forest, bringing
      enemies down silently. \u201CWe are the ones who seize opportunity in darkness.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992209
    m_Localized: "An assassin whose lightning\u2011fast movements surprise enemies
      like a flash of light. By the time they blink, it\u2019s already over!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992210
    m_Localized: An assassin wielding twin blades, dancing through darkness. With
      every deadly step, foes fall helplessly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992211
    m_Localized: A single dagger strike from a distance! Their specialty is silencing
      victims before they even realize it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421794992212
    m_Localized: "The ultimate assassin ruling from the shadows\u2014no one can escape
      this silhouette."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
