  - m_Id: 9421799186555
    m_Localized: Summons 10 Skeletons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186556
    m_Localized: Grants a Level 2 Attack buff to monsters within range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186557
    m_Localized: Heals the HP of monsters within range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186558
    m_Localized: Applies a Level 3 Slow debuff to heroes within range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186559
    m_Localized: Deals damage and applies a Level 2 Burn debuff to heroes within
      range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186560
    m_Localized: Heals all monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186561
    m_Localized: Sacrifices the selected monster to recover Summon Gauge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186562
    m_Localized: Consumes Mana to recover Summon Gauge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186563
    m_Localized: Fully restores the Summon Gauge, but disables its regeneration for
      10 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186564
    m_Localized: Teleports monsters within range to the area around the fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186565
    m_Localized: The fortress becomes immune to damage for 10 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186566
    m_Localized: Summons monsters near the fortress that last for 30 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186567
    m_Localized: Summons obstacles that block movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186568
    m_Localized: Summons zombies that explode after a set time or upon death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186569
    m_Localized: Applies a debuff to the selected hero that causes instant death
      after a set time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186570
    m_Localized: Grants a Level 2 Attack + Attack Speed buff to monsters within range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186571
    m_Localized: Consumes 50% of HP of monsters within range and grants a Level 3
      Attack + Attack Speed + Movement Speed buff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186572
    m_Localized: Increases the HP and size of monsters within range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186573
    m_Localized: Deals damage and applies a Level 2 Decay debuff to heroes within
      range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421799186574
    m_Localized: Summons lasers on heroes within range, dealing damage and applying
      a Level 1 Slow debuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421803380736
    m_Localized: Strikes the area with lightning, dealing damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9421803380737
    m_Localized: Pulls heroes within range toward the direction of the orb.
